485301.description:
WZ Jardins is located 1 km from Avenida Paulista and the Consolação subway station. Congonhas Airport is 9 km away and we are 1 block from the new Oscar Freire metro station. The hotel has free Wi-Fi internet, meeting rooms and a 24-hour reception.

The accommodations have air conditioning, LCD cable TV, minibar and work desk.

The hotel offers breakfast with fresh fruits, breads, cakes, juices and cold cuts.

The Restaurant will reopen from the 1st of September 2020, serving breakfast, lunch, dinner and room service until 22:00;
We are attentive to hygiene protocols to receive guests with care and due security;
We emphasize that the Academy is not available at the moment due to security protocols;
Minors: according to Law No. 8.069 / 1990, it is mandatory to present a travel authorization for unaccompanied minors from legal guardians.
It is also mandatory to present the documentation and authorization letter with a notarized signature when unaccompanied by one of the legal guardians, in addition to presenting the minor's document;
**** WE DO NOT ACCOMMODATE MINOR UNACCOMPANIED EVEN WITH TRAVEL AUTHORIZATION ****
Upon check in, a valid credit card will be requested as a guarantee for any extra expenses

1113066.description:
Hotel Rural Maia dos Reis is the result of the rehabilitation of an old farmhouse dating back to 1719, listed as a heritage site of municipal interest. 

It is the ideal place for a peaceful stay in a refined environment, whether for leisure, business, or as a stop on the Camino de Santiago in Galicia, whether on foot, by bicycle, or on horseback. 

This property offers equipped suites with a private bathroom with shower. 

Breakfast at Maia dos Reis is served free of charge every morning. 

Its location is strategic, combining the charm of the countryside with proximity to major urban centers and access roads. 

It is located:
• 15 minutes from Francisco Sá Carneiro International Airport;

• 25 minutes from the historic center of Porto and the Douro riverside area;

• A few minutes from the S. Frutuoso train station, with a direct Porto – Valença connection;

• 30 minutes from São Bento train station, with direct connections to Porto – Braga – Guimarães – Aveiro – Douro Valley;

• Close to the motorways: A3, A4, A28, A29 and A41;

In the vicinity, visitors will also find golf courses such as Vale de Pisão, the Silva Escura racecourse, the Vilar de Luz aerodrome, beaches on the Atlantic Ocean and, about 70 km away, the snowy landscapes of the mountains and the Douro wine region, providing a diversity of experiences at any time of year.
